teractions and whether they could affect crew morale on extended flights.\n- What would change my vote: Credible evidence that B\u2019s interpersonal style has led to safety\u2011critical incidents, or strong evidence that another candidate (e.g., A) has demonstrably superior crew\u2011working performance despite their drawbacks.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
